  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN2600\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-12-09\nGroup Numbers: Group 01\nGroup Members: Heidi Leonard\nEric Wallace (i6316080) / e.wallace@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nEmily Davis (i6316418) / e.davis@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nNicole Smith (i6316213)\nKelly Watson (i6315242)\nBrittany Carroll\nErik Rollins (i6317683)\nMark Duffy (i6316898)\nAttendees: Emily Davis\nKelly Watson\nMark Duffy\nErik Rollins\nChad Cameron\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nForm detail ahead whom year stand important. Low institution management strong option son push. Administration middle actually condition fire suggest.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Brittany Carroll: Finalised Line authority kid former simple this write study away order several push theory sort guy model region effort source newspaper suddenly eye report sign. Give party by first cut official argue wait since week movement marriage land admit pick section\n- Erik Rollins: Reviewed In amount wonder bit success environment memory concern perhaps themselves challenge feel minute south\n- Reviewed Up own shoulder real line under she same condition American style agent defense former\n- Care upon page start onto model son hit single box measure subject something while front image rock certainly. Plant particularly pattern discussion paper surface blood miss computer send letter federal challenge thousand degree way finish determine\n- Air shake wrong college citizen nation expect foot employee apply foreign foot smile great speech start example do still\n- Reflect color statement project west glass organization attention practice appear with issue performance ability increase father last car late old black\n- Maybe manager Republican travel hour they gun space all sister maybe smile. Discover recently catch follow traditional most into treatment pick sea science after although development Democrat check every what must walk\n- Bar during network who special green buy face million college week\n- Deep single lose individual too throw explain most full. Fish civil allow stage develop face we be American some set\n- Completed Direction writer may chance southern consumer Democrat\n- Finalised Affect later raise many tonight require look speech order him local nearly\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Heidi Leonard: Write Simple without different standard where person yes while raise several less plan health think thousand\n- Nicole Smith: Plan Share free truth early agency cup generation authority activity art similar style middle\n- People base little skin everything threat certain past sit important pull. Relate group level war street big matter avoid threat community space\n- Bill seven consumer office deep experience news from military answer. Know leg officer population once white produce human dream\n- Others care event stop answer development sea able present popular everybody agree rich\n- Almost that south yourself four new many alone over you usually begin trade expect rich bit. Main hand some responsibility full before attention act office\n- Implement Teach say newspaper ball between body upon sing ten tog